---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="このサイトについて | SETOUCHI ATLAS"
  description="ランドスケープ ＝ ネイチャー ｘ カルチャー。自然と人の営みがつくる瀬戸内の風景を旅するエッセイ集。編集主幹：藤崎壮滋（ぴあぴあ株式会社）。"
>
  <section class="reader-about-minimal" aria-labelledby="reader-about-title">
    <p class="reader-about-kicker">HELLO, SETOUCHI! <span aria-hidden="true">✳</span></p>
    <h1 id="reader-about-title">このサイトについて</h1>
    <div class="reader-about-description">
      <p class="reader-about-concept">合言葉は、<strong>ランドスケープ ＝ ネイチャー ｘ カルチャー</strong>。</p>
      <p>海や山、風や潮。そこに暮らす人の工夫や、受け継がれてきた仕事。二つが出会うと、いつもの風景がちょっと違って見えてきます。旅先で見つけた「なんで？」から、瀬戸内の物語をたどるエッセイ集です。</p>
      <a class="reader-about-start" href="/setouchi-cultural-economic-atlas/book/">エッセイをのぞいてみる ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="reader-about-editor">
      <h2>編集主幹</h2>
      <p><strong>藤崎壮滋</strong> <span>（ぴあぴあ株式会社）</span></p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <style>
    .reader-about-minimal{
      max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;
      padding:clamp(42px,6.5vw,78px) 24px 100px;
      color:#294b41;
      font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN","Yu Gothic",sans-serif;
    }
    .reader-about-kicker{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;
      padding:7px 13px;margin:0 0 17px;
      border-radius:99px;background:#ffe9d9;color:#b75f42;
      font-size:.71rem;line-height:1.4;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;
    }
    .reader-about-kicker span{font-size:1.02rem;color:#dd9960}
    .reader-about-minimal h1{
      margin:0 0 25px;
      font-family:inherit;font-weight:800;
      font-size:clamp(1.95rem,3.7vw,2.85rem);
      line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-.04em;
      color:#274f44;
    }
    .reader-about-description{
      max-width:none;
      border:1px solid #e5e9dc;
      border-radius:23px;
      background:linear-gradient(125deg,#fff8eb 0%,#fffdf8 60%,#f0f8f1 100%);
      padding:clamp(22px,4vw,38px);
    }
    .reader-about-description p{
      font-size:clamp(.98rem,1.35vw,1.09rem);
      line-height:1.95;
      margin:0 0 17px;
      color:#566c61;
    }
    .reader-about-description .reader-about-concept{
      font-size:clamp(1.02rem,1.55vw,1.17rem);
      color:#2c574a;
      font-weight:700;
      line-height:1.92;
    }
    .reader-about-description strong{
      display:inline;
      padding:.14em .28em;
      background:#e2f2e9;
      color:#2e715e;
      font-weight:800;
      border-radius:8px;
      -webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;
      box-decoration-break:clone;
    }
    .reader-about-start{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
      margin-top:8px;padding:11px 18px;
      border-radius:99px;background:#2c7565;color:#fff!important;
      text-decoration:none;font-size:.86rem;font-weight:800;
      transition:transform .2s ease,background .2s ease;
    }
    .reader-about-start:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);background:#245a51}
    .reader-about-start:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #e6a373;outline-offset:3px}
    .reader-about-editor{
      margin-top:27px;padding:19px 23px;
      border:1px solid #e6e9e2;border-radius:17px;
      background:#fffdf9;
    }
    .reader-about-editor h2{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;
      margin:0 0 9px;font-family:inherit;
      font-size:.77rem;letter-spacing:.08em;
      font-weight:800;color:#b56b4d;
    }
    .reader-about-editor h2::before{content:"✦";color:#dfaf67}
    .reader-about-editor p{margin:0;font-size:.97rem;line-height:1.7;color:#536d61}
    .reader-about-editor strong{font-weight:800;color:#2d4d44}
    .reader-about-editor span{color:#87978c}
    @media(max-width:600px){
      .reader-about-minimal{padding:34px 17px 70px}
      .reader-about-minimal h1{margin-bottom:20px}
      .reader-about-description{border-radius:18px;padding:22px 18px}
      .reader-about-description p{line-height:1.87}
      .reader-about-editor{padding:17px 18px}
    }
    @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.reader-about-start{transition:none}}
  </style>
</BaseLayout>